{"overview":"الهام گرفته از یک بازیکن والیبال کوچک‌دست، هیناتا در آخرین سال دبیرستان متوسطه‌اش تیم والیبال می‌سازد. متأسفانه تیم او در اولین مسابقه‌اش با تیم «پادشاه زمین» توبیو کگیاما روبه‌رو می‌شود و حتماً شکست می‌خورد. پس از شکست سنگین، هیناتا قسم می‌گیرد که کگیاما را پشت سر بگذارد. پس از ورود به دبیرستان، هیناتا به تیم والیبال می‌پیوندد و متوجه می‌شود که توبیو نیز به تیم پیوسته است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Inspired by a small-statured pro volleyball player, Hinata creates a volleyball team in his last year of middle school. Unfortunately the team is matched up against the \"King of the Court\" Tobio Kageyama’s team in their first tournament and inevitably lose. After the crushing defeat, Hinata vows to surpass Kageyama After entering high school, Hinata joins the volleyball team only to find that Tobio has also joined.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":9,"y":2015,"poster":"/i7LuGtsez0kA91V3BycxSgtQPPD.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":25,"y":2014,"poster":"/8GpgkSjPlZv4Qr1qlc4elNU8tra.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":25,"y":2015,"poster":"/4FhLQ9uivEJ3BVWBwU2e6BBqeAi.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":10,"y":2016,"poster":"/oZpXPM42i9NUigjCBR1sW9q6eWf.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":25,"y":2020,"poster":"/a6bNLY3F90ldNe6PqPSQGFqOE58.jpg"}],"episodes":85,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"村瀬歩","role":"Shoyo Hinata (voice)","photo":"/3aGM6KpcCIEKOXP9510tzaKc8uw.jpg","en":"Ayumu Murase"},{"name":"石川界人","role":"Tobio Kageyama (voice)","photo":"/fzjIkotjUHHs3wgftM9tqdsG8ph.jpg","en":"Kaito Ishikawa"}],"trailer":"KhZG9Uw7PxM","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/60863/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind